      "definition": "Form, appearance, figure, features, mien, or external condition; by extension, beauty or goodliness.",
      "usage_conditions": "The term can describe a person's outward appearance or the pleasing quality of that appearance.",
      "source_refs": [
        "lane:entry:39531"
      ]
    },
    {
      "meaning_id": "cm_shura_clothing",
      "headword_arabic": "شُورَةٌ",
      "definition": "Clothing, apparel, ornament, or finery.",
      "usage_conditions": "The sense concerns outward adornment and may include beautiful or ornamental apparel.",
      "source_refs": [
        "lane:entry:39531"
      ]
    },
    {
      "meaning_id": "cm_shura_fatness",
      "headword_arabic": "شُورَةٌ",
      "definition": "Fatness or a well-fleshed condition.",
